aware person so somebody who knows about the problems that exist the solution aware person who knows about the different solutions that exist to solve the problem say for example you have lower back pain they know they can get a better chair a cushion a massage or surgery then there's product aware so they actually know about your product or services they know exactly about yours and the last one is the most aware

