person so they are about to purchase your product and so in terms of awareness let me show you how they differ there are more people that exist that don't know about the problem solution your product and are ready to buy than there are people who are most aware and in terms of readiness to purchase the it goes in this direction where at the top they are not ready to buy and at the bottom they are ready to buy let me tell you exactly

