how your marketing and advertising differs depending on the stages of awareness. So for the unaware audience, you need to focus on using statistics and questions that expose hidden pain points. Have you ever sat down on your desk working really hard and feel like you have to stand up every five minutes? Well, maybe it's because the chair that you're sitting on secretly is destroying your...

